 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B>Facility Warrants</B>&#148; has the meaning attributed to that term in Section&nbsp;2.8(a)(ii);
</P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B>Financial Instrument Obligations</B>&#148; means, with respect to any Person, obligations arising under: </P>
<P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
