 <P STYLE="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B></B>&#147;<B>IFRS</B>&#148; means International Financial Reporting Standards, as issued by the
International Accounting Standards Board;<B> </B></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B></B>&#147;<B>Indebtedness</B>&#148; means, with respect to a Person, without duplication:<B> </B></P>
