financial instruments and obligations with respect to bankers&#146; acceptances and contingent reimbursement obligations relating to letters of credit; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
