of the type referred to in paragraphs (a)&nbsp;to (f)&nbsp;above; </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B>Indemnified Parties</B>&#148; has the meaning attributed to
such term in Section&nbsp;11.1 hereof; </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B>Indemnified Taxes</B>&#148; means Taxes imposed on or with respect to any payment made by or on account
of any obligation of any Credit Party under any Facility Document, other than Excluded Taxes; </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">&#147;<B>Individual Commitment</B>&#148; means, in respect
