<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The obligation of the Lenders to make the Advance of the Facility under this Agreement is subject to and conditional upon the following conditions precedent
being satisfied, fulfilled or otherwise met to the satisfaction of the Agent and the Lenders on or before the Drawdown Date (or such other date as is mutually agreed to in writing between the Borrower and the Agent), or waived by the Agent in
accordance with Section&nbsp;9.13: </P> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
