Permitted Encumbrances, or undertakings of the holders of the liens to deliver releases and discharges promptly after the Advance; and </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
