<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">if such Taxes are an Indemnified Tax, pay or provide to the Agent in addition to the Payment to which the Agent
